# Maintenance disposition tree for a production asset with safety and condition gates.
decisiontree "Equipment Maintenance Decision"
q "Is the equipment safe to operate?"
  yes: q "Is condition monitoring within alarm limits?"
    yes: q "Is preventive maintenance due this month?"
      yes: a "Schedule planned maintenance"
      no: a "Continue operation and monitor"
    no: q "Can the fault be corrected during a planned stop?"
      yes: a "Plan corrective work package"
      no: a "Reduce load and arrange urgent repair"
  no: q "Can the hazard be isolated immediately?"
    yes: a "Isolate, lock out, and inspect"
    no: a "Emergency shutdown and escalation"
